{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"杏林在線｜何謂高血壓？\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/APP-ONLINE-I-BP-261102.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】血壓高是常見的慢性疾病，量度的標準有時候是因人而異，怎樣為之有血壓高？何時要服用血壓藥呢？今集《杏林在線》請來中大醫學院賽馬會公共衞生及基層醫療學院副教授、家庭醫學專科醫生李錦培講解。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T13:41:16.049157+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":100,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T13:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T06:18:39.804336+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T13:38:38.478679+00:00","content_hash":"07ecaa89a08311c1c5e67e0e098dafb224b7d0a1515b687e6e5ab53f67bf1c3c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-02T13:41:16.049157+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}